/-!
# Local form-native P286 gauge-connection variation

The actual primitive path `A + t a` generates its non-Abelian curvature jet
and the scalar and Dirac charged jets together.  This module substitutes those
three generated outputs into the authoritative form-native mother density.

The gauge BF coefficient is the metric-free four-form pairing

`W_P286(B, D_A a)`.

It is not multiplied by `generatedVolumeDensity` and it does not pass through
a spacetime Hodge operator.  The scalar and Dirac coefficients retain the live
coordinate volume factor carried by the matter density.  The resulting exact
quadratic polynomial is derived from one primitive connection occurrence; no
historical combined action derivative, momentum, Euler residual, stationarity
receipt, supplied current, or fixed actual is consumed.
-/

namespace
  SaturationMonoid.PhysicsCore.StageNineFormNativeP286GaugeConnectionLocalVariation

open EmpiricalReferenceScaleCouplingBoundary
open ProofFreeRicherAnholonomicSource
open DiracExteriorMatterAction
open StageNineDynamicBreakingVacuum
